ets/enrollment/overview.mdx","Elige la política de admisión y conecta DMS, confianza inicial y cliente EST.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview",{"_86":324},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx",{"_69":70,"_64":326,"_71":-7,"_72":-7,"_73":-7,"_75":-7,"_66":327,"_62":335,"_84":336,"_82":338},"Integraciones",[328],{"_62":329,"_69":79,"_64":330,"_73":331,"_82":-7,"_12":332,"_84":333},"es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core",{"_86":334},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations",{"_218":337},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg>","es:platform/iot-fleets",{"_218":341},"platform/iot-fleets/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\"